    "updated_at": "2026-11-27T22:40:13Z",
    "body": "Not claimed. This issue waits for PR #4173 (#3237, Chamfer lead-in and lead-out).\n\n- PR #4173 changes the same functions: `chamfer_with_tolerance` and `chamfer_open_runs` in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/chamfer.rs` (it moves the open-chain code to `chamfer_open.rs`). It also changes the Chamfer DTO, the project version and `mill2d_more_page.rs`.\n- PR #4173 does not merge with main now. `git merge-tree` shows conflicts in `chamfer.rs`, `generate.rs`, `project/file.rs`, `project/apply.rs`, `machining2d/mod.rs` and `fields.rs`. Its base is 653 commits behind main. It has `needs-rework` and `conflicts`.\n- A branch stacked on that head cannot be gated against the main that it lands on. AGENTS.md: \"An overlap that cannot stack waits for the parent to merge.\"\n- This issue also asks that the #3237 leads apply to each pass. That work needs the final #4173 code.\n\nNext step: claim this issue when PR #4173 merges, or when it merges cleanly with main.\n",
